-``.1`` (.1 -> .2 ... up to FCA11_SHADOW_KEEP generations; the oldest is dropped) and a drive writes at most
-FCA11_SHADOW_MAX_BYTES (then one k="trunc" record). Writes are buffered and flushed ~1/s and at every episode end / V3
